# Commands run by the launchd job com.hakios.demo (see com.hakios.demo.plist).
# The cameras for Darwin (RC_JOBS=rc.jobs.camera, with cam=5; with cam_pattern=1 its frames are colour bars):
# first what AVFoundation lists (camera_avtest: the device is libhakios.media.dylib's in mediaserverd,
# camera_device.c, whose frames come from the kernel's /dev/hakios-camera), then Camera.app opened from the home
# screen as a finger opens it (with cam=5 the loader's /arm-io/isp node puts its icon on the first page, top right),
# its preview left running for 20 seconds, then the front/rear switch tapped and the front's preview left for 20
# (xl screenshot meanwhile). The kernel's "camera:" lines say when the frames came and why they stopped;
# mediaserverd's "hakios: camera:" lines what the capture stack asked of the device.
# The first line used to be /redwood/bin/sound_test springboard; on 2026-11-11 it
# never returned, so neither camera_avtest nor the taps ran (logs/121542-run.log,
# screenshot camcheck-rear.png shows the home screen). The camera path does not
# need it. camera_avtest does not return either (it keeps its session open; its
# own evidence is logs/122328-run.log), so it stays out of this scene -- the
# taps below are the UI check, and Camera.app opens the device itself.
# The taps wait for SpringBoard this time. The demo job starts when launchd
# does -- a second or two into the kernel -- while SpringBoard's window server
# and first frame take minutes: in the 20:15 run SpringBoard spawned at 20:20:53
# and the job's taps at 20:16:2x hit a screen that was not there yet (no
# "camera:" session, logs/201553-run.log). The Camera icon is at 0.855 0.36 of
# the screen (camui-front.png), the flip button at 0.886 0.871. The app's
# preview starts about 130 s after the tap (kernel t≈435 in logs/202610-run.log),
# so captures ~520-580 s after the run command catch it (the kernel starts ~105 s
# into it); the taps at 300/330 s were verified by the kernel's session lines.
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 300 swipe 0.5 0.99 0.5 0.4 250 wait 3 tap 0.845 0.36 wait 30 tap 0.886 0.871 wait 30
